  <@connector from="task-review" to="implement-task" label="fix (max 5), or next task" enforced="prompt">
    <@when>
      Reviewer reports spec failure, any Critical or Important finding, or a 'cannot verify' item the controller confirmed as a gap. Also taken (to the next task's implement) when the review is clean or parked at the cap and more tasks remain.
    </@when>
    <@by>model</@by>
    <@how>
      Controller reads <file-ref of=superpowers name="fix-loop.md" path="skills/subagent-driven-development/references/fix-loop.md"/> before every round. Rounds 1-3 resume the original implementer with the findings verbatim; rounds 4-5 dispatch a fresh implementer on a more capable model. Each round ends with a scoped re-review. Minor findings and plan-mandated conflicts leave the loop. At the cap the controller adjudicates each open finding itself and parks it with a ledgered ruling. The controller never fixes itself.
    </@how>
